### Terraform (infra/) - state and local provider cache are machine/run-specific, *.tfvars can
### hold the admin/deploy public keys inline if someone uses one instead of -var flags ###
infra/.terraform/
infra/*.tfstate
infra/*.tfstate.*
infra/*.tfvars
infra/*.tfvars.json
infra/crash.log

